y file the group touches outside uv.lock/pyproject.toml is under .github/, and public reports tie this exact 400 to non-actions ecosystems changing files under .github/ (laazyj/composureCDK#651, shyden-labs/shyden.co.uk#1118, athob/py-EnBiD-ananke#12; cleared by moving or excluding them), with a counterexample noted in glsec/glsec.github.io#43. GitHub has not confirmed the mechanism, so this is the leading supported cause, tested by the fix.\nHANDOFF STATE 06:00 PST: fix committed in .rebar/worktrees/fix-dependabot as 518f46f166d (with eagleeyed-lexical-midge), not pushed: `exclude-paths: [\".github/**\"]` on the uv entry (documented option; note dependabot-core#15102 reports the uv dependency-graph builder ignoring it). GitHub reruns Dependabot whenever dependabot.yml changes, so the merge itself triggers the run AC2 needs. Next: make verify, push, merge, read the triggered run.","timestamp":1794491840561009029},{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"AC2 met, 2026-11-12 PST. Change 3377 merged as eaf824e8ff5 (10:56 PST); the dependabot.yml change triggered uv run 43285155106 (10:57 PST). Its job definition carries \"exclude-paths\":[\".github/**\"]; the log has 0 mentions of release-requirements (the prior runs recompiled .github/release-requirements.txt twice), no create_pull_request 400, and Dependabot opened PR #147 \"deps: bump the uv-lock group with 23 updates\" at 11:07 PST. This supports the .github-file hypothesis for the 400: removing that file from the group was the only change, and the group PR now opens.","timestamp":1794510546828798442},{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"HANDOFF STATE 2026-11-12 PST: CLOSED (class preexisting, completion signature signed). Change 3377 merged as eaf824e8ff5; uv run 43285155106 opened PR #147 with no create_pull_request 400. Plan review and close ran through the worktree CLI on the Anthropic API (anthropic:claude-sonnet-5-5) while the Bedrock spend cap held.","timestamp":1794524340965794001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1793829312220779001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"0b3e29e7-6f7d-44f7-9403-31935d69d040","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ad14-c714-4619-4cd2"},{"link_uuid":"b46ce88f-6850-4d22-b9b4-a421b35a1713","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"abf1-0ad9-70e3-448b"}],"description":"## Observation\nDependabot Updates run 41918750684 (weekly uv version update, 2026-11-04 13:43 PST), the first uv run after the uv floor landed (e0ab18822c6), ran uv 0.13.5 with no tool_version_not_supported error, built 25 dependency changes in group 'uv-lock', then `POST /update_jobs/1681618238/create_pull_request` returned 400: 'The request contains invalid or unauthorized changes' (recorded as dependency_file_not_supported). No pull request was opened. The log does not name the files in the rejected payload. Earlier uv runs never reached this step: uv refused the exact pin before any update ran.\n## Testing\n\nChecked: the Dependabot uv run triggered by the dependabot.yml change (`gh run view <id> --log`) shows exclude-paths in the job definition, no release-requirements recompile, no create_pull_request 400, and an opened uv-lock group pull request.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] [non-codebase] Root cause of the 400 identified from evidence (which file or change Dependabot's API rejected), before any fix.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Dependabot Updates runs for navapbc/rebar; principal=gh CLI repo reader; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view --log of runs 41918750684 and 43105554680 (create_pull_request 400, .github/release-requirements.txt recompiled), recorded in ticket comments\n- [x] [non-codebase] A later Dependabot uv run opens the uv-lock group pull request or records no create_pull_request error.\n  provenance: environment=GitHub Dependabot Updates run 43285155106 for navapbc/rebar; principal=gh CLI repo reader; privilege_posture=production-equivalent; instrument=live-call — gh run view --log (exclude-paths in job, no create_pull_request 400) and PR #147 opened, recorded in ticket comments","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":".github/dependabot.yml","reason":"exclude .github from the uv scan"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[["relates_to","abf1-0ad9-70e3-448b"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"4777b929-fbd7-408e-887c-d7f186ae4b69","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"29a8-46e2-628e-463d","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Dependabot uv-lock group PR creation rejected with 400 'invalid or unauthorized changes'","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f53b0d41-ae1b-471f-97ac-59a8bd6ad827","1ff4869b-21aa-4296-b627-7f2c1f6a4af9","02c297e0-a57b-45af-a883-56f15217c471","c45132e8-40b6-4c37-96cf-d96dc97b2a25","b46ce88f-6850-4d22-b9b4-a421b35a1713","1b7bac76-1e6b-4395-a9ca-f5a5fe6b7c9a","7300afb4-46b7-48e9-a6fe-8f8cf97f580d","eb0c8d99-5580-4502-8930-b15f388cef7b","f3128517-1614-474c-829c-b0bdef20c4bd","4777b929-fbd7-408e-887c-d7f186ae4b69","9e0602a2-61f5-4e99-b799-5f80cb9cad97","3d8f47e0-862a-469e-97b7-82a0fd3bf133"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794524340965794002,"uuid":"1a17e9b4-d416-4056-9bf3-375ecdef53f2"}